{"id":"1be2daa6a7dea6a3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Locally Finite Family","display":"df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family — ZFC Top4 Locally Finite Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family — ZFC Top4 Locally Finite Family","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-locally-finite-family — ZFC Top4 Locally Finite Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span>（有限集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite\\text{-}family}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\bigl(\\{A\\in\\mathcal A:U\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite\\text{-}family}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S(X,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\Bigl(x\\in U\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\bigl(\\{A\\in\\mathcal A:U\\cap A\\ne\\varnothing\\}\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每一点都必须有一个开邻域只与族中有限多个成员相交。</li>\n<li>显式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>，避免把任意对象族误当成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的子集族。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S$（拓扑空间谓词，见 [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S$（有限集谓词，见 [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4LocallyFiniteFamily}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}locally\\text{-}finite\\text{-}family}\\v